Proton looks up the parent of a process connecting to the master socket
with SO_PEERCRED and /proc/<pid>/status.  OpenBSD has SO_PEERCRED with
struct sockpeercred and no /proc: use sysctl(KERN_PROC_PID) p_ppid.

